%H A402445 Evangelos Kranakis and Michel Pocchiola, <a href="https://ir.cwi.nl/pub/2021/2021D.pdf">Enumeration and visibility problems in integer lattices (extended abstract)</a>, Journées de Géométrie Algorithmique (Sophia-Antipolis, 1990), INRIA, 100-109; also in Proc. Sixth Annual Symposium on Computational Geometry, ACM, 1990, 261-270.
%H A402445 Joshua D. Laison and Michelle Schick, <a href="https://people.willamette.edu/~jlaison/seeing_dots.pdf">Seeing Dots: Explorations on the Visibility of Lattice Points</a>, author manuscript; published as Seeing dots: Visibility of lattice points, Math. Mag. 80(4), 274-282, 2007.
